Variant 2: adaptive pause->yield->park backoff in the mutex spin.
Branch: yield-backoff (1 commit on main). Verdict: better than pure pause but
still does not beat plain yield (see FINDINGS.md §4); the per-iteration-reload
confound in the c-8 experiment made it look worse than it is. Not a merge
candidate. NOTE: this variant keeps main's periodic RELOAD_SPIN_MASK reload;
the reload-cadence sweep (§4.1) suggests that reload is itself the bigger cost.

